 "captions": [
  [
   0.0,
   2.659,
   "So far we have measured the uncertainty of"
  ],
  [
   2.659,
   4.321,
   "one source at a time."
  ],
  [
   4.321,
   6.315,
   "But the world comes in pairs."
  ],
  [
   6.315,
   7.313,
   "Clouds and rain."
  ],
  [
   7.313,
   8.975,
   "A symptom and a disease."
  ],
  [
   8.975,
   11.301,
   "A word and the word before it."
  ],
  [
   11.933,
   14.592,
   "So let's learn to slice uncertainty apart when"
  ],
  [
   14.592,
   15.257,
   "two variables,"
  ],
  [
   15.257,
   16.254,
   "X and Y,"
  ],
  [
   16.254,
   17.251,
   "are tangled together."
  ],
  [
   17.883,
   19.545,
   "Start with the joint entropy,"
  ],
  [
   19.545,
   21.539,
   "written H of X and Y."
  ],
  [
   21.539,
   24.198,
   "It is just the total surprise in the"
  ],
  [
   24.198,
   24.531,
   "pair,"
  ],
  [
   24.531,
   27.19,
   "considered together \u2014 everything you do not know"
  ],
  [
   27.19,
   28.519,
   "about both at once."
  ],
  [
   29.151,
   31.81,
   "The beautiful fact is that this total splits"
  ],
  [
   31.81,
   33.14,
   "cleanly into three blocks."
  ],
  [
   33.14,
   34.137,
   "Watch the bar."
  ],
  [
   34.768,
   35.766,
   "On the left,"
  ],
  [
   35.766,
   38.425,
   "the part of X that Y tells you"
  ],
  [
   38.425,
   40.419,
   "nothing about \u2014 X's private uncertainty."
  ],
  [
   40.419,
   42.413,
   "We call it the conditional entropy,"
  ],
  [
   42.413,
   44.075,
   "H of X given Y."
  ],
  [
   44.707,
   45.704,
   "On the right,"
  ],
  [
   45.704,
   48.031,
   "the mirror image \u2014 Y's private uncertainty,"
  ],
  [
   48.031,
   49.693,
   "H of Y given X."
  ],
  [
   50.324,
   51.654,
   "And in the middle,"
  ],
  [
   51.654,
   53.648,
   "the piece the two variables share."
  ],
  [
   53.648,
   55.31,
   "Hold onto that middle block;"
  ],
  [
   55.31,
   57.637,
   "it is about to become a star."
  ],
  [
   58.269,
   60.928,
   "Now here is the single most useful identity"
  ],
  [
   60.928,
   61.925,
   "in the subject,"
  ],
  [
   61.925,
   63.919,
   "and the bar makes it obvious."
  ],
  [
   63.919,
   64.917,
   "The chain rule."
  ],
  [
   65.548,
   68.207,
   "The joint entropy H of X and Y"
  ],
  [
   68.207,
   69.869,
   "equals the entropy of X,"
  ],
  [
   69.869,
   72.528,
